                                                "sense_id": "b5c88f62-1c68-30bd-afb8-12116332bffb",
                                                "text": "A sudden stillness came on them both, a sense of something momentous that must happen. Flory reached across and took her other hand. It came yieldingly, willingly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a311273b-eb79-4a1f-873d-f07632cef7e4",
                                                "sense_id": "b5c88f62-1c68-30bd-afb8-12116332bffb",
                                                "text": "The wet sand is as dark and more yieldingly solid than fudge and waking across a panful is a promenade in the Kingdom of Sweets."
                                            }
